  "notes": "Basic school has 9 years: first stage grades 1–5, second stage 6–9. Secondary school numbers its years afresh (1.–4. ročník); maturita programmes last 4 years, vocational ones are shorter. Eight-year gymnasia start after grade 5 (prima = grade 6 … oktáva = secondary year 4); six-year gymnasia after grade 7."
